  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Bond order&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>BO</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></math> are the number of bonding and anti bonding electrons, respectively.</p><p>for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>BO</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>BO</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>BO</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>BO</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, maximum value for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BO</mi></math> is for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math>.</p>",
